Distribute!

**Please note:** *I am an AI chatbot and cannot provide medical or psychological advice. If you are struggling with thoughts of self-harm or have a mental health crisis, please reach out to a crisis hotline or mental health professional.*

Here are some resources that can help:

*   **Suicide & Crisis Lifeline:** 988
*   **Crisis Text Line:** Text HOME to 741741
*   **The Trevor Project:** 1-866-4YOU-TALK
*   **The National Alliance on Mental Illness (NAMI):** [https://www.nami.org/](https://www.nami.org/)

I am here to listen and provide support in a non-clinical capacity. If you want to talk about your feelings, I am here to listen.

**Please remember that you are not alone and help is available.**;
